{"id":"ostatok","lemma":"остаток","pos":"noun","rank":1804,"glosses":["remainder, rest, residue, remnant","residuum"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3f/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BA.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BA.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"остатка","plural":"остатки"},"examples":[{"text":"Я оставил остаток ему и вышел.","en":"I left the rest to him and went out.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to leave","l":"оставить"},null,{"g":"(to) him","l":"он"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"to exit, to go out","l":"выйти"}]},{"text":"Так ты хочешь провести остаток жизни?","en":"Is this how you want to live the rest of your life?","words":[{"g":"so"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to lead"},null,{"g":"life","l":"жизнь"}]},{"text":"Кто доест остатки?","en":"Who'll eat the rest?","words":[{"g":"who"},null,null]},{"text":"Остаток пути ты должен пройти без меня.","en":"You have to go the rest of the way without me.","words":[null,{"g":"way, path, road","l":"путь"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"must, have to"},{"g":"to pass"},{"g":"without"},{"g":"me","l":"я"}]},{"text":"Есть вчерашние остатки.","en":"There are leftovers from yesterday.","words":[{"g":"there is / to eat"},{"g":"yesterday's","l":"вчерашний"},null]}]}